# LF everywhere, in the index and the working tree. Git for Windows ships
# core.autocrlf=true system-wide, so without this every file not listed
# below was checked out CRLF on the Windows side, which WSL git (no autocrlf)
# then reports as fully rewritten, and which a dirty-tree flake eval copies
# into the store as-is.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary

# Force text (no auto-detection) for files that break outright with CRLF.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.nix text eol=lf
config/scripts/tmux-sessionizer text eol=lf
